@startuml
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
title UC-21 - Create Return Request

actor "User" as Actor
boundary "My Orders / Product Review UI" as FE
control "ReturnsController" as API
control "ReturnsService" as Service
database "MongoDB: returnRequests, bills" as DB

Actor -> FE: Start UC-21
FE -> API: POST /returns
API -> Service: Execute Create Return Request
Service -> DB: Read/write returnRequests, bills
DB --> Service: Domain data
Service --> API: Result
API --> FE: Response
FE --> Actor: Return request PENDING

alt Alternative / exception flow
  note over FE,Service: Đã có return request cho sản phẩm này -> 409
end

note over Actor,DB
Pre: Đã đăng nhập, có đơn hàng PAID
Post: Return request PENDING
Main flow:
1. User vào My Orders
2. User chọn đơn hàng, bấm Return/Exchange
3. User chọn type: RETURN / EXCHANGE / REFUND
4. User chọn sản phẩm, color, size cần trả
5. User nhập lý do
6. User thêm ghi chú (optional)
7. User bấm Submit
8. System gọi API POST /returns
9. System lưu return request (status: PENDING)
end note
@enduml
